# React components

## Stack

- Functional components; `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, events, browser APIs)
- shadcn/ui + Radix in `src/components/ui/`; Tailwind v4 for styling
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod resolver; match existing field components

## Structure

- Page-specific UI: colocate under route or `src/components/<feature>/`
- Shared primitives: `src/components/ui/`
- Props interfaces named `<Component>Props`; export types when reused

## Patterns

- Prefer server components for data fetching; pass serializable props to client children
- Use existing `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes
- No `console.*`; surface user-facing errors in UI state, log server-side via `@/lib/logger`
- Match existing naming: PascalCase files, kebab-case route folders
